// Console actions: who revoked admin rights, approved enrollments or changed settings in
// the Altiward console. UserName is who did it (an email with single sign-on, otherwise a
// console token's fingerprint) and DeviceSerial the Mac acted on, if any.
// Tags: altiward
AltiwardOCSF_CL
| where ClassUid == 6003 and tostring(Ocsf.api.service.name) == "Altiward console"
| project TimeGenerated, UserName, Action = tostring(Ocsf.api.operation), DeviceSerial, Message
| order by TimeGenerated desc
